#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/tools.md:1 docs/sap/tools.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Tools"
msgstr "SAP 工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:8
msgid ""
"Satellites register **local tools** on the Habitat. The agent invokes them "
"during a bound session; Habitat forwards execution to the Satellite via "
"`tool.call` and waits for `tool.result` / `tool.error`."
msgstr ""
"Satellite 在 Habitat 上注册**本地工具**。代理在已绑定的会话期间调用它们；Habitat 通"
"过 `tool.call` 将执行转发给 Satellite，并等待 `tool.result` / `tool.error`。"

