#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/tools.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration flow"
msgstr "注册流程"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite\n"
"  participant Habitat as Habitat\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Habitat: req tool.register tools local_name description parameters\n"
"  Habitat->>Habitat: SatelliteManager.registerTools\n"
"  Habitat->>Sat: res registered canonical names\n"
"  Note over Agent: later during message.send stream\n"
"  Agent->>Habitat: invoke sap_* tool\n"
"  Habitat->>Sat: evt tool.call call_id local_name args\n"
"  Sat->>Sat: execute local handler\n"
"  Sat->>Habitat: req tool.result call_id content\n"
"  Habitat->>Agent: resume turn\n"
msgstr ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite\n"
"  participant Habitat as Habitat\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Habitat: req tool.register tools local_name description parameters\n"
"  Habitat->>Habitat: SatelliteManager.registerTools\n"
"  Habitat->>Sat: res registered canonical names\n"
"  Note over Agent: later during message.send stream\n"
"  Agent->>Habitat: invoke sap_* tool\n"
"  Habitat->>Sat: evt tool.call call_id local_name args\n"
"  Sat->>Sat: execute local handler\n"
"  Sat->>Habitat: req tool.result call_id content\n"
"  Habitat->>Agent: resume turn\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:60
msgid ""
"Register via `tool.register` with `SapToolDefInput`: `local_name`, "
"`description`, `parameters` (JSON Schema object), optional `return_kind` "
"(`json` | `text`), optional `private` (default `true`)."
msgstr ""
"通过 `tool.register` 注册，参数为 `SapToolDefInput`：`local_name`、"
"`description`、`parameters`（JSON Schema 对象），可选 `return_kind`（`json` "
"| `text`），可选 `private`（默认 `true`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:62
msgid "On disconnect, Habitat unregisters all tools for that app/instance."
msgstr "断开连接时，Habitat 会注销该 app/instance 的所有工具。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/tools.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Strict routing"
msgstr "严格路由"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:66
msgid ""
"SAP-prefixed tool names **never fall back** to Habitat-local tools with the same "
"name. `SatelliteManager.installToolRouting()` wraps "
"`ToolSetRegistry.getTool` to enforce this."
msgstr ""
"以 SAP 为前缀的工具名称**绝不会回退**到 Habitat 上同名的本地工具。"
"`SatelliteManager.installToolRouting()` 包装 `ToolSetRegistry.getTool` 以强制"
"执行此规则。"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"  Invoke[Agent invokes sap_* tool]\n"
"  Parse[parseSapToolName]\n"
"  BindCheck{Session platform_extra matches app and instance?}\n"
"  Online{Instance connected?}\n"
"  Registered{Tool in toolIndex?}\n"
"  Proxy[Forward tool.call to Satellite]\n"
"  Reject[toolError with reason]\n"
"\n"
"  Invoke --> Parse\n"
"  Parse --> BindCheck\n"
"  BindCheck -->|no| Reject\n"
"  BindCheck -->|yes| Online\n"
"  Online -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Online -->|yes| Registered\n"
"  Registered -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Registered -->|yes| Proxy\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"  Invoke[Agent invokes sap_* tool]\n"
"  Parse[parseSapToolName]\n"
"  BindCheck{Session platform_extra matches app and instance?}\n"
"  Online{Instance connected?}\n"
"  Registered{Tool in toolIndex?}\n"
"  Proxy[Forward tool.call to Satellite]\n"
"  Reject[toolError with reason]\n"
"\n"
"  Invoke --> Parse\n"
"  Parse --> BindCheck\n"
"  BindCheck -->|no| Reject\n"
"  BindCheck -->|yes| Online\n"
"  Online -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Online -->|yes| Registered\n"
"  Registered -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Registered -->|yes| Proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:88
msgid "Common rejection reasons:"
msgstr "常见拒绝原因："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Condition                                   | Result                                        |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Session not bound to satellite app/instance | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Instance offline                            | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Tool not registered on connected instance   | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Unregistered `sap_*` name                   | Guard handler returns error (no Habitat fallback) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 条件                                        | 结果                                          |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 会话未绑定到 satellite app/instance         | 拒绝                                          |\n"
"| 实例离线                                    | 拒绝                                          |\n"
"| 工具未在已连接实例上注册                    | 拒绝                                          |\n"
"| 未注册的 `sap_*` 名称                       | 守卫处理器返回错误（不回退到 Habitat）            |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:97
msgid ""
"Session binding requires `platform_extra.satellite_app_id` and "
"`platform_extra.satellite_instance_id` set at `conversation.create` time."
msgstr ""
"会话绑定要求在 `conversation.create` 时设置 "
"`platform_extra.satellite_app_id` 和 `platform_extra.satellite_instance_id`。"

