#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:114
msgid ""
"`instance_id` is a Habitat-assigned 3-character `[a-z0-9]` string, globally "
"unique across all SAP apps. Habitat returns the assigned or confirmed id in "
"`connected.instance_id`."
msgstr ""
"`instance_id` 是 Habitat 分配的 3 字符 `[a-z0-9]` 字符串，在所有 SAP app 间全局唯"
"一。Habitat 在 `connected.instance_id` 中返回分配或确认的 id。"

